+
+# E4-style profiler feedback, standard regime: the previous candidate's B300
+# kernel breakdown is written as PARENT_PROFILE.md. Aggregated by kernel name --
+# it answers "which kernel is hot" and nothing about gaps between them.
+#
+# On the GPT-2 block this signal is unusually legible: the first passing kernel
+# spent 94.6% of GPU time in attention_kernel.
+profiling:
+  enabled: true
